  "scopeNotes": [
    "These figures reproduce one Stellarium Chinese sky-culture mapping at the pinned commit; Chinese asterism identifications and line figures vary by historical period and scholarly reconstruction.",
    "principalHipIds accepts only common_names entries named as the mansion plus an unqualified Roman numeral. Added stars, separately named subordinate asterisms, and question-marked candidates are excluded.",
    "lines contains only contiguous sourceLine runs whose every adjacent endpoint is in principalHipIds. Removing a non-principal vertex never creates a new edge. sourceLines preserves the pinned Stellarium input verbatim.",
    "The source states that Wings has 22 proper stars and 7 added stars, but provides only 15 unqualified HIP mappings, 3 question-marked candidates, and no mappings for 4 proper-star ordinals."
  ],
